{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/27d2bfd8c14b68a68b8fbb7ed2b43b1e.avif?t=1773155709\" width=1020 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbloom is a deck builder rogue-like where the cards are balls instead.\u00a0 Orbloom takes those moments in deck builders where you get a powerful item synergy which 'breaks' the game and turns that into a core gameplay loop.\u00a0 Each run will have you acquiring various different physics based abilities and you'll have to think out of the box about how to combine them in order to pass an exponentially increasing round goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/f67fff7babd42ae0c36eef1d3841e872.poster.avif?t=1773155709\" width=382 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/f67fff7babd42ae0c36eef1d3841e872.webm?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/f67fff7babd42ae0c36eef1d3841e872.mp4?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through out each run you'll add new balls to the arena with their own unique abilities or level up the ones you already have.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/dbadffab85befdd5378e7ba3f04be75d.poster.avif?t=1773155709\" width=294 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/dbadffab85befdd5378e7ba3f04be75d.webm?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/dbadffab85befdd5378e7ba3f04be75d.mp4?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/15086ad615964364e606d70d9fc05104.poster.avif?t=1773155709\" width=294 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/15086ad615964364e606d70d9fc05104.webm?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/15086ad615964364e606d70d9fc05104.mp4?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score higher and higher as you build up your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/cd19eb6853f51c89a0921c979a016efe.poster.avif?t=1773155709\" width=294 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/cd19eb6853f51c89a0921c979a016efe.webm?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/extras/cd19eb6853f51c89a0921c979a016efe.mp4?t=1773155709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may look luck-based but a successful run will require  creative problem solving and strategy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Got the ball rolling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/fcfaad7a8729ebd97a0273337c8089d8aa3b8f8b.jpg"},{"name":"First milestone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/909639198bda242e28fc0b4c0c5b92bd06bf2620.jpg"},{"name":"Roll up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/9c4de9b9639a13b6494e17be484c2e1f3425dbbb.jpg"},{"name":"Ball alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/049e1e3e1783e3bf9249c3bf622a5741db0d512b.jpg"},{"name":"Ball together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/373cc2e5306bf24e5d80aa145da45d2b648829bd.jpg"},{"name":"Milked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/f02db19dcb88dbd5f2f96ab2af9d19ce5e342048.jpg"},{"name":"Marge'd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/c2cdcaf45aba6d6a37f348bc7574986ff213af89.jpg"},{"name":"Disco'd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001460/5427d76060498fe6648ab50a3fda26732a550146.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001460?t=1773155709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001460?t=1773155709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/c503e3c0b4c6914f6c65fc2728b1bf8a3bd5ca89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773155709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001460/c503e3c0b4c6914f6c65fc2728b1bf8a3bd5ca89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773155709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4018490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class